      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KING SAINT (3) scored last time out by 3.5 metres in a nice return to form at Mildura over 2190m. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Facing a tougher assignment but he is capable of running another big race. RUDIMENTARY (1) has been excellent of late and he made it two in a row when successful at his latest appearance over 1740m at this track, getting home by 3 metres. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Won't find this any harder and he can take care of this line-up. KATUNGA EXPRESS (8) has to come into calculations on the back of some strong recent form, most recently when third at Melton over 1720m. Must be included. KIA ORA BEAUTY (7) is in the mix following a respectable second at her most recent appearance over 1740m at this track.",
